# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# A press on a handle that has not travelled half the pick tolerance is a
# click: nothing moves. Only a real drag moves the handle (the maintainer's
# review of 31 October 2026: a click right after selecting moved something).
import ui/editor/bim_editor.dl

function check drag threshold {boolean:condition} named {a string:label}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            print ((the string form of "FAIL: ") + label) as a line
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "exit", nothing, 1)
        print ((the string form of "PASS: ") + label) as a line

set editor to a new bim editor
set e to the address of editor
set target to the address of (editor's documentValue's current)
set levelId to add bim level named (the string form of "Ground floor") at 0.0 with height 3.0 to target
set editor's levelId to levelId
set gridId to add bim grid named (the string form of "A") from (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 10.0) reaching -1.0 to 4.0 to target
set gridFound to the bim grid index of gridId in editor's documentValue's current
# Press on the selected grid's far end handle (0.275 m beyond the end at
# this tolerance, #61), then tremble 0.03 m along it (the half tolerance is
# 0.05 m). The end keeps its distance from the pointer.
select bim editor bim grid picked numbered gridId in e
move bim editor pointer to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 10.275) within 0.1 in e
press bim editor pointer in e
check drag threshold editor's dragging named (the string form of "a press on a grid end begins a drag")
move bim editor pointer to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 10.305) within 0.1 in e
set held to the item at gridFound's position in (editor's documentValue's current's grids's values)
check drag threshold ((the absolute value of (held's finish's y - 10.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "a tremble of 0.03 m moves nothing")
move bim editor pointer to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 10.775) within 0.1 in e
set pulled to the item at gridFound's position in (editor's documentValue's current's grids's values)
check drag threshold ((the absolute value of (pulled's finish's y - 10.0)) > 0.4) named (the string form of "a real drag of 0.5 m moves the end")
# Once moving, the drag keeps following the pointer.
move bim editor pointer to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 11.475) within 0.1 in e
set stepped to the item at gridFound's position in (editor's documentValue's current's grids's values)
check drag threshold ((the absolute value of (stepped's finish's y - 11.2)) < 0.011) named (the string form of "once moving, the drag keeps following the pointer")
